    "q-75954": {
      "dom_id": "step-q75954",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "Which value of $x$ satisfies the equation $\\frac{x-4}{{x}^{2}}-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}=\\frac{2}{x}?$",
      "worked_solution": "We note that $x=0$ cannot be a solution since division by $0$ is undefined. \n\nThe equation has the denominators ${x}^{2}$ and $x.$ So first, we find the least common multiple (or $\\text{LCM}$) of the denominators. We find that\n\n$$\n\\text{LCM}({x}^{2},x)={x}^{2}.\n$$\n\nSo, we multiply both sides of the equation by ${x}^{2},$ and simplify: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{x-4}{{x}^{2}}-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{2}{x} \\\\ {x}^{2}\\cdot (\\frac{x-4}{{x}^{2}}-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}) & ={x}^{2}\\cdot (\\frac{2}{x}) \\\\ {x}^{2}\\cdot (\\frac{x-4}{{x}^{2}})-{x}^{2}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}) & ={x}^{2}\\cdot (\\frac{2}{x}) \\\\ \\cancel{{x}^{2}}\\cdot (\\frac{x-4}{\\cancel{{x}^{2}}})-\\cancel{{x}^{2}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\cancel{{x}^{2}}}) & =x\\cdot \\cancel{x}\\cdot (\\frac{2}{\\cancel{x}}) \\\\ (x-4)-1 & =2x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now have a linear equation in $x,$ and we can solve this using the addition and multiplication principles:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-4)-1 & =2x \\\\ x-5 & =2x \\\\ x & =-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we recall that we cannot allow $x=0$ as a solution. But since $x=-5\\ne 0,$ we conclude that the solution is $x=-5.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-75954-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "4",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"21\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-75954-b",
